  more than 2h out                           +0.046(z=+2.5)     +0.190(z=+5.0)
  exchange quote AWAKE (moved in last 30m)     +0.089(z=+2.8)     +0.138(z=+2.9)
  exchange quote RESTING (frozen 30m)        +0.001(z=+0.1)     +0.176(z=+3.3)

  READ: a bookkeeping artifact concentrates where membership changes and
