=== threshold sensitivity: events re-detected at each cut (sportsbook moves) ===
   thresh  events  mean size        kalshi antic% (p) polymarket antic% (p)
     1.0p      55       1.4p             27% (p=0.001)          17% (p=0.000)
     1.5p      18       1.9p             22% (p=0.031)          17% (p=0.008)
     2.0p       7   (too few events to read)
     3.0p       0   (too few events to read)
  Read: across 2 readable cut(s) the anticipation share spans 17%-27%
  — BELOW 50% throughout, i.e. the exchanges had if anything drifted the
  wrong way before a book jump. There is no anticipation to find at any
  cut, so the null is a property of the data rather than of where the
  event boundary was drawn.
  Significantly below chance for both exchanges at: 1.0pt, 1.5pt.

  only 7 clean non-overlapping events at THRESH=2pts — underpowered at this window width

