=== 4. MIRROR: does the book follow the exchanges within 5 min? ===
  around kalshi moves >=2pts (n=77): book responds +0.00 pre / +0.11 at / -0.01 post (total +0.10pts, same-step share 105%)
  around polymarket moves >=2pts (n=258): book responds +0.04 pre / +0.12 at / +0.02 post (total +0.34pts, same-step share 36%)

